<title>THAILAND: Thai central bank scraps Friday notes auction.</title>
<headline>Thai central bank scraps Friday notes auction.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-07-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Thailand said on Thursday that it had cancelled its auction of a total 4.0 billion baht ($143 million) in short term notes set for Friday.</p>
<p>&quot;Due to the changing market liquidity, the Bank of Thailand called off the auction ...&quot;, the central bank said in a statement.</p>
</text>
